{"key":"StoryData/P10706.json|/dataList/3/content","kr_sha":"6f4043551d52c33b66f27bf649252f6323f8e0d1384de7c4eaaedfb5c25ed8ea","zh":"不過……只是憑直覺想到的東西，我又怎麼能寫得出原因呢？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10706.json|/dataList/4/content","kr_sha":"44396117ff6a1051c8b3b5f8f3c56ddc601744083f1a96348c38d96bdfcf8ed1","zh":"自我在這工作起已經很久了……這期間早已見識過數百起的事件現場。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
