{"key":"StoryData/P10706.json|/dataList/6/content","kr_sha":"a4072b2972aad2cbf67ba1575da898c385bf5eb467c572a93f31c11238a94f45","zh":"經歷過那樣的生活後……我便能立刻想出謀殺現場成型的過程和殺人的原因，這也不是什麼了不起的能力。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10706.json|/dataList/7/content","kr_sha":"f8c91eaba1b8526004f06f8f4a7d7e242a27778e17a286b25d200edcbe4e3976","zh":"但我不像懸疑小說裡的安樂椅偵探，一眼就能看穿整個現場和陰謀。有時候，線索也會在混亂中遺忘掉，而且……啊，我的頭……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10706.json|/dataList/8/content","kr_sha":"5676098101490ca59ba471c694058c69f8af461ad46bbc00132ec4e2077fd0ea","zh":"他們給我安了個「分析師」的名號，還強迫我每天都寫這些該死的報告……我快瘋了要。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
